# Checkpoints: keep the small, real full-scale + capacity-sweep run records
# (they're the raw evidence behind the paper's reported numbers) but not the
# quick/smoke-preset scratch checkpoints, which are large in aggregate and
# not meaningful on their own.
results/checkpoints/*
!results/checkpoints/.gitkeep
!results/checkpoints/full_*.json
!results/checkpoints/capacity_sweep_*.json
